# Allow-list: the build needs the workspace manifests, the lock file and every workspace member
# (cargo loads each member's manifest even when it builds only anima-hub).
*
!Cargo.toml
!package.json
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!apps/desktop/src-tauri/
# The web stage: manifests, the lock file and the client sources.
!bun.lock
!apps/client/
!apps/desktop/package.json
!apps/site/package.json
!quality/package.json
!design/package.json
!deploy/package.json
!deploy/dns/package.json
!deploy/headscale/package.json
# Excluded anywhere, after the allow lines (the last matching line wins).
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.svelte-kit
**/build
**/dist
**/.env*
**/secrets
**/.DS_Store
